      "bonuses": [
        {
          "name": "Faith is All",
          "description": "<p>When spending a Fate point to gain a +10 bonus to any one test, an Adeptus Ministorum character gains a +20 bonus instead.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "recommended": ["Chirurgeon", "Hierophant", "Seeker", "Warrior"],
      "description": "<div class='bc-entry'><p class='bc-lead'>The great religious agency of the Emperor of Mankind; with shrines and cathedrals on a million worlds, they are dedicated to spreading and teaching the word of the Emperor so all might bask within His light and fear His wrath.</p><div class='bc-rule'><p>The Adeptus Ministorum, also known as the Ecclesiarchy, is the religion that venerates the Emperor of Mankind. Powerful and ancient, it embodies the Imperial Creed, the myriad systems of belief that bind humanity together, gives it purpose, and keeps it safe from soul-imperilling threats both within and without. Whether with words or deeds, a member of the Adeptus Ministorum never forgets his earlier service.</p></div></div>",
      "source": "Dark Heresy Second Edition, p. 54"
    }
  },
